{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33112","headline":"赠卖松人 · 于武陵","name":"赠卖松人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入市虽求利，怜君意独真。\n劚将寒涧树，卖与翠楼人。\n瘦叶几经雪，淡花应少春。\n长安重桃李，徒染六街尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于武陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「赠卖松人」条，撰者张应中、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"张应中"}